==Galician==

===Etymology===
From Old Galician and {{inh|gl|roa-opt|aparecer}} (13th century, {{w|Cantigas de Santa Maria}}), from {{inh|gl|LL.|appārēscere}}, present active infinitive of {{m|la|appārēscō|t=begin to appear}}, from {{inh|gl|la|appareō}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|gl|[apaɾeˈθeɾ]|[apaɾeˈseɾ]|qual2=western}}

===Verb===
{{gl-verb|aparec|er|pres=aparezco}}

# to [[appear]]

